Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Funnel Health as its own tab; Overview now shows
 everything combined
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Per clarified structure: Overview | Funnel Health | Metrics Table |
Trend | Report. Overview is the "see everything at once" destination —
it now composes the verdict/diagnostic content, the metrics table, and
the executive report into one scrollable page (with real section
dividers between them, same top-divider pattern used for report
section breaks). Funnel Health, Metrics Table, and Report each also
exist as their own focused tab showing just that one piece, sharing the
exact same JSX (computed once per render, not duplicated) rather than
three copies of the same markup.

Added a 5th "health" mode to the shared RunViewMode type/registry in
view-switcher.tsx, additive like "report" was — doesn't affect other
consumers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AkznvRLnBokzbdmJ2WwaEM
